  Data-model:     beol

  Fields (7):
    title                   text                 1-n  Title
    hasAuthor               link → person        0-n  Author
    hasText                 text                 0-1  Text
    isPartOfCollection      link → Collection    0-n  is part of  [from biblio]
    hasURI                  uri                  0-n  URI  [from biblio]
    arkUrl                  uri                  1      (built-in)
    hasStillImageFileValue  still-image          1      (built-in)

